{"id":10000073,"name":"纳西妲","enName":"Nahida","title":"白草净华","element":"草","region":"须弥","rarity":5,"weapon":"法器","birthday":"10月27日","constellation":"智慧主座","description":"深居净善宫的笼中之鸟，只能在梦中将世界尽收眼底。","affiliation":"须弥城","cv":{"chinese":"花玲","japanese":"田村由加莉","english":"金伯利·安妮·坎贝尔","korean":"朴恃奫"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000073-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000073-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Nahida.zip","voicePackageEn":"Nahida","quoteCount":75,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"初次见面，我已经关注你很久了。我叫纳西妲，别看我像个孩子，我比任何一位大人都了解这个世界。所以，我可以用我的知识，换取你路上的见闻吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_draw_appear_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d5/jc88qeb59kdazupqubj3vq9bpkq8c2q.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·邀请","desc":"不知道干什么的话，要不要我带你去转转呀？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/2d/cd45sfm1jl8katsi68th5gsh2r2w4vm.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·心事","desc":"又有心事吗？我来陪你一起想吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f4/fm2otnsxjo5he9bokl45qgg5zv3o7m8.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·感受","desc":"果然要亲眼去看，才能感受到世界的美。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b8/kp1p8m2nfk52ra5zj3ooqqjlf6purc5.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"快去避雨吧，小心头顶上长出蘑菇哦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/jvfjc29bc9nn52d7amaoin7kmx2uei0.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"你知道吗？雷鸣是生命的前奏，很快这片大地就会充满生机。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/97/k0jdox49qynd4eaciwtbfoahybefj0u.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"听见了吗？天空正对万物轻语：「睡觉时间到了哦。」","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/15sgqrp3w91367jzaum0akdmtyzbh6l.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"天气真好啊，暖洋洋的，我们的身边马上也要热闹起来了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/87/fq2d0at0m0tfft9pvrttiecgw2g036k.mp3"},{"title":"起风的时候…","desc":"宫殿里可不会起风呢…哦，抱歉，对你来说是理所当然的知识吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_weather_breezy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/db/0ge6jv9iasfqn5foqiei4ek6nvnwz4m.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早上好，我们赶快出发吧，这世上有太多的东西都是「过时不候」的呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/56/7pxus6ga385e6him2gmx14ditkqtrz6.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"午休时间到，我想喝树莓薄荷饮。用两个和太阳有关的故事和你换，好不好？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/78/s4qwut7gh8hgtepgzqx318xhugch9fo.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"太阳落山啦，我们也该把舞台让给夜行的大家族了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/ek04ovrgfl4o9xrr9944kf91opn7y93.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"快去睡吧，放心，我已经为你准备好甜甜的梦啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/f2f9hch936vfakytu76iivmiq7jfv5i.mp3"},{"title":"关于纳西妲自己·见识","desc":"烬寂海啊，那里什么都没有，就像蕈猪的脑子一样空空如也，我当然知道。啊？我…我确实没有亲眼见过，那也是我所触及不到的地方呀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/78wzmo54kzd37hz7u3yn04tnr3aqzqd.mp3"},{"title":"关于纳西妲自己·痴迷","desc":"神明只送给人类填饱肚子的知识，人类却借此制作了工具，书写了文字，壮大了城邦，现在又放眼星辰与深渊…他们每时每刻都在创造全新的「知识」，也令我再也无法移开双眼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8c/nzhtsdglzy3k8xwfsjd2e3nuz5oeo37.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·故事会","desc":"你旅途中的见闻，比我学习到的知识要精彩太多，而且我还能随时提问，把所有的细节都了解到一清二楚…真是太满足了。好了好了，别浪费时间，我们快继续吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fb/3t8ybkh2ly76swgnqlm6eiqg9fabnuu.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·旅行","desc":"我早就不满足于当一个听众了，一直都想出去看看。你冒险经验这么丰富，当我的向导好不好啊？你之后所有的故事，我都想亲身感受。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/55/1jyr30p9cq01yxz1u2hc4h4pvzxo25v.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"天空长出眼睛是为了见证大地的美好，而本来就拥有双眼的人类，是在什么样的情况下，才需要靠「神之眼」观察这个世界呢？这个问题的答案，聪明的你能够明白吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/6l0m13plpn2ee40ikv59m9sv64f8clz.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享…","desc":"很多时候，我们直到经受切肤之痛，才不得不直视自身的懒惰，愚昧，鲁莽或傲慢。但大可不必为此懊悔，我们无法观测未来的所有可能性，只能靠这样略显笨拙的方式获取知识。学费而已，再正常不过啦。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/n9zikvu4tfifn2uv2ab30abqwege4ko.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻·未见之花","desc":"须弥的沙漠看上去比雨林缺乏生机，但它也承载了久远的文明，孕育了稳定的生态。等哪天它不再和雨林吵架了，一定能开出我从来没见过的花吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0b/pi4ukqginydihu2hy98jfigplzqq5c4.mp3"},{"title":"关于赛诺·笑话","desc":"他讲的笑话确实深奥，还挺有意思的。嗯？你有哪句没听懂吗？那我解释给你听吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_cyno_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/noz39222a9lkg0w5sorc2bycfq6y3oh.mp3"},{"title":"关于赛诺·职责","desc":"在面对秩序与正义的冲突之时，不是每一位「大风纪官」都能得出绝对坚定的答案。他应该最清楚，妥协的结果只有无路可退，所以他现在能回到属于他的位置上，对整个须弥而言都是一大幸事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_cyno_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/j50vk6q4x8aoxioefbyi46zjn2c6hoc.mp3"},{"title":"关于提纳里…","desc":"雨林能够对抗「死域」的侵蚀，至今都生机焕发，巡林官们的付出举足轻重，而提纳里又是他们之中的佼佼者。只是…希望他可以稍稍温柔一些，这样才更有利于巡林员招新纳贤嘛。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_tighnari_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/da/cn1drsly9vswr9i6vgzuxanwputfp8m.mp3"},{"title":"关于柯莱…","desc":"我听说过她的故事，她的坚韧如宝石般璀璨夺目。她经历了太多，希望须弥的葱绿能够长久地庇护她，令她像普通的女孩子那样健康成长。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_collei_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/e9/oq9j6kt9m9qhrptjhw8hj921nlutka3.mp3"},{"title":"关于艾尔海森…","desc":"他拥有很超前的知识体系，并且每时每刻都在保持思考，或许这个世界上没有什么事能瞒过他吧。然而对智慧者而言，普通人的凡庸是一种与生俱来的错吗？那都是「我们」不可分割的一部分。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_alhaitham_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/7c/8xfhhjkwyzd7wginz9j0btdqbsy45i0.mp3"},{"title":"关于妮露…","desc":"我曾经借用别人的身体，问她想不想让小吉祥草王来看她的舞蹈…虽然我已经悄悄看了很多次，但按理来说，应该要我本人到场，才算是对她「花神诞祭」表演的尊重。结果我却被委婉地拒绝了…唔，有点伤心。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_nilou_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/kh00kgp90i0vlsqsycg75alo0kkzx30.mp3"},{"title":"关于多莉…","desc":"她见到我的第一句话就是，「我看上了你的宫殿，怎么卖啊？」净善宫怎么可能卖给她呢？不过她的问题确实把我问住了，我想了好久，也不知道净善宫该定价多少摩拉…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_dori_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8d/o55bf60q3l03t2fiiclyohowzxwvw72.mp3"},{"title":"关于卡维…","desc":"他对须弥推行智慧这一事的理解，已经非常接近本质了，很可惜的是，他掌握的真相无法成为这个国度的主流。什么？你说他和艾尔海森是室友？世上居然还有这种可能性…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_kaveh_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/eb/3kfe3lbiixvgbz5zo6od1s0dqhqc3f9.mp3"},{"title":"关于珐露珊…","desc":"她的身体遭受了赤王遗迹中残留力量的影响，就像是被时间这只大乌龟不小心甩下了背，永远忘在了身后。如果你感兴趣的话，应该能从她身上窥见过去须弥的一角吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_faruzan_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a6/jxb23delkelh7o42sef27qaysxo8bnq.mp3"},{"title":"关于尘世七执政·引荐","desc":"好像尘世七执政之间在很久很久以前还会定期联络，只是我的情况比较特殊，已经不记得这段经历了…既然须弥的混乱告一段落，我觉得我该重新见他们一面。你熟识的那几位神明，能为我引荐一下吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_theSeven_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/9shhqumha6co51vmh9oqsk409t398id.mp3"},{"title":"关于尘世七执政·游戏","desc":"听说玩游戏能够快速缩短人与人之间的距离。神也是如此吧。不如，在和大家相聚之后，我就主动提议一起玩「跳房子」…好像也不合适。弄得像是我把房门做成了小小的洞口，仗着自己的优势欺负大家一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_theSeven_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cf/4rlxgxoxjskn9zttlyxoi50f3daq8i0.mp3"},{"title":"关于散兵…","desc":"当他自认为追寻已久的愿望终于实现，他眼中所见的究竟是满足，还是更大的空虚呢？正是因为我们不会飞，才会无比向往天空…让他好好想想吧，在拥抱过空无一物的天空之后。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_scaramouche_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ca/mlmyq7feorwj0dr8v5ppyrg1fhph5mi.mp3"},{"title":"关于芙宁娜…","desc":"人们常说，智慧并不取决于知道些什么，而是取决于可以改变些什么。毫无疑问，那个「预言」早就刻写在了世界树中…明明好像一切都没改变一样，但又好像什么都已经改变了。你我都知道，她是聪明到可以扭转世界命运的人呀。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_teammate_furina_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fa/av4fi7m61mhcib9y51hyi9yvt9d9n2q.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解纳西妲·其一","desc":"我的过往相当单调，估计你听上一会儿就会像炮鲀吸水那样打哈欠。不过好奇心是弥足珍贵的东西，我也不想浪费…既然这样，我给你分享一些我做过的梦吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/2n4bwpzel0ymijws3yitf90p9n8cnes.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解纳西妲·其二","desc":"我的梦中总会出现一个花盆，每次浇水施肥就会长出相同的花。对于完全确定的收获，你还能享受养花的过程吗？呵呵，对我来说，至少每次开花之后飞过的蝴蝶，都有不一样的颜色，有时候还会有蜜蜂呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5a/aipxwic5aacuq8e75if1pl4vvjc5qkl.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解纳西妲·其三","desc":"我的梦中总会出现一个沙漏，我喜欢往里面加一点点水，搅匀之后看它走完一次需要多长时间，和上一次又差了多少。没有规律，也没有意义，却能带走我大脑积累的疲惫，我想「什么都没有」正是它的乐趣所在。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/19/8ypcjcid77jkb2y5fuvnrotceza78mm.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解纳西妲·其四","desc":"我的梦中总会出现一片空地，无论周遭的景色如何变化，它都会占据最重要的位置，挺奇怪的吧？我觉得这里曾经应该存在过什么东西，可就算我驱使梦境的权能也无法获得答案。唔，居然梦中也有我不能掌控的东西…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/69/aws4wvryssmpggdmkqdsul0mr6hc15c.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解纳西妲·其五","desc":"我的梦中什么都有，唯独缺少来来往往的人。但在与你相遇之后，这里渐渐变得热闹了。或许你在梦中扮演的是「向导」这样的角色，不仅让我的梦变得更有人情味，也带我走出了牢笼。呵呵，走吧，接下来的旅途也请你引路了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0e/10mu3lnn8oo2mxendh7mq71ntse7mba.mp3"},{"title":"纳西妲的爱好…","desc":"就这么看着你，算是爱好吗？因为你的一举一动都让我很好奇啊。作为世界的旅行者，你从哪里来，将到哪里去，会遇到什么人，战胜什么困难，都是我想寻求的答案。你不用太在意我，就让我一直观察你吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1b/6w3lc4y18m8b6uiuh4nt934iba3r403.mp3"},{"title":"纳西妲的烦恼…","desc":"我自认为我擅长提问和回答问题，但我渐渐明白，有很多人是揣着明白装糊涂，问题的答案并不能帮上他们的忙。是不是随着年龄增长，大家都会失去面对质问和答案的勇气呢…","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/ej6ghndcroybv6tsm19qn5m6d4fz7ot.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"当然是枣椰蜜糖了，只要吃上一小块，大脑就会噼里啪啦地飞速运转，没什么问题解决不了。唯一需要注意的是，装蜜糖的罐子不能放在太容易伸手够到的地方。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_pref_foodLike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5f/qs6upl5nglakxbry982fjyt8cxt0c6s.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"那些海鲜，它们在无边无际的黑暗中出生，成长在我所不了解的海底深处。要我吃下它们，就好像要我咽下一团脏兮兮的乌云一样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/df/1otrpkf7ls1q0oef1tj8tpa0olpxc48.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"像这样的好味道，应该被世界永久记录下来。谢谢你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b1/tvy37sm6etocqw2sknh6s3c7cqrl352.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"呵呵，你的心意我收到了，味道也可圈可点。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fd/odqo3ojvet5350bd1nnodxmhkt7l963.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"…怎么说呢？打比方的话，你不会给狗狗喝蔬菜汁吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ca/63joqri9dydqb2qpdmxkkbelvt5kjij.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"我想了想，要庆祝你的生日，至少也要像「花神诞祭」一样隆重…欸？太夸张了吗？可是我都让人准备好了，走吧走吧，仅限一次也好，绝对会让你满意的！","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/o74hrkjnaigkrskk8jc2q6c62kgcm4n.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"变聪明啦~","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/almrax52aza4v4fafjoj1icq9u2wcws.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"思路变得更开阔了，天空和大海都能装进去。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/43/374pqgmddajs5rrysbm5tp16piegy46.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"这种感觉，就像月莲找到了莲叶，珊瑚真珠找到了贝壳。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b4/1evk8pww3crui4f8u607rwvekb4jadi.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"感谢你愿意让我成为你的同伴，还教会了我那么多新的知识。我以智慧之神的名义为你赐福，从今往后不再会有困惑阻碍你的旅途。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4a/79urqfapo5muc73txpf02ictt11kork.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"记住你了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/72/7678oawwhywqopmagpk2n13aj9qiyao.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"蔓延吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/88/6dsp6b4jx5zvygq9g3vzm5eb03pag5y.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"等下有点痛哦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/22/bqd0omsev7t8nip4s4z2i4mt9fw434x.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其四","desc":"嘿！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill1_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4e/rcc9idsfedga3ji19py6t5vfwj8ft3s.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其五","desc":"手牵手~","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill1_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/37/5jdewkjl32opxbzfcxdmcoovfovhuz7.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其六","desc":"全都看见咯。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill1_06","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/3a/q6lkwgmdp1texq0we26rw60e5kkco9p.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"来我家做客吧~","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/32/kgfdhyegf97mpzdc1uuox83wq74nuaz.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"知识，与你分享。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5e/ib10ei7vd1xz5v0umnuyqlnpybukjum.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"此即智慧之殿堂。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/8o9uhfp217edto0vhy3oj08ct2un67n.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"好奇心值得嘉奖哦。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/5b/pva78fedg3w84kd5y8gdqjcmsly7aaj.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"是源自谁的馈赠呢？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/e/ec/52moz5qtnhvct5czo5fquylunujf9lz.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"有你想要的吗？","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/68/71s26zt4q31h0k8wmxph3z8jpbt3jw0.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"换个策略吧。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/rv0k8pa7rmy0vt0q340i034t46kmwaw.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"别打啦！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/2o7jxzyxo45wo9wqv3xhm7ues4miybs.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"这样不太明智…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bb/0v7pc8qobnwnq04rwsu8cxzzdx09wg8.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"让我来想想办法。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/22/n3dfzzmlrdoycgzees2evl74d0lczfu.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"别再硬撑了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d0/olfaxqtn9t3if46lunlk1d4g29fov8b.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"生命…终有尽时…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/6fo5ccaxw0k8rqlioral2npkuqqg50n.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"枯萎之刻…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/65/rilba2vvzlq54t35w0f6aulei2ts361.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"我…不明白…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/25/3v2kbc8achugpb42iqc71fuv2pkkizp.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"好痛啊。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f9/5v4f5idkeum34hck6eor38vjtvaf2sb.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"被打晕了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_nahida/vo_nahida_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/4whyx2hr9td3kayp27wf5sdeqo905t6.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"我等你好久啦。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_nahida_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/85/0k75xa9r4mfvs0rf2w68hkzoziidiq5.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"没去过的地方还有很多呢。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_nahida_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/83/6jpew1fv4xuhngbvvaypf0ymfbpa1t3.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"又可以增长见识了。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_nahida_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/4tfvpcljw6jeovoddtsqgme70pplzgc.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000073-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000073-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1284,"fullArtHeight":1019}